                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "-No exit button \r\n-Upon closing the game and reopening it your progress has gone back a few levels forcing you to complete them again if you want gold medals on every level\r\n-Won't learn much outside of hiragana and katakana shapes and pronunciations + dakuten & handakuten.\r\n-Besides the achievements for them, you won't learn any Japanese words or sentences.\r\n-Lack of being able to use the keyboard to type in the characters for mystery kana.\r\n\r\nA noble attempt but overall not a very good learning tool and an otherwise lengthy puzzle game.",
